if the cluster be not there , add it ( where my cluster 's name be snowflake ): 
 sacctmgr add cluster snowflake 
 failure to do so will result in the slurmctld fail to talk to the slurmdbd after the switch . if you plan to upgrade to a new version of Slurm do not switch plugin at the same time or you may get unexpected result . do one then the other .

