for example , if your application be call abc , rename abc to abc_real and create a wrapper script that be call abc : 
 bsub -R " rusage[abc_license=1 : duration=1 ] " abc_real 
 when user run abc , they be actually run a script to submit a job abc_real to LSF that use 1 share resource name abc_license .

for example , if your the LSF_TOP directory for your cluster be /usr / share / lsf / conf , add the follow line to the .cshrc ﬁle : 
 source /usr / share / lsf / conf / cshrc.lsf 
 for sh , ksh , or bash shell : 
 add the proﬁle.lsf ﬁle to the end of the .proﬁle ﬁle for all user : 
 copy the content of the proﬁle.lsf ﬁle into the .proﬁle ﬁle .

monitor dynamic share resource 
 for LSF to receive external load index correctly , the ELIM must send a count of the available resource to standard output in the following format : 
 number_indexe
